---
/**
 * /guides/cake-for-x-guests — Audience content group.
 * Covers w1.ac8 — "useful content for customers".
 * Content drawn directly from brandbook §5 Appendix C Reference 2.
 */
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Choosing a cake for your guests"
  description="A small guide to choosing the right HappyCake for your guest count and occasion. Plain English, practical steps."
>
  <section class="bg-happy-blue-900 text-text-on-blue py-12">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4">
      <p class="text-happy-blue-200 cake-name-label mb-2">◆ Audience guide</p>
      <h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-semibold text-cream-50">
        Choosing a cake for your guests
      </h1>
      <p class="text-happy-blue-200 text-sm mt-2">A short, practical guide.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
    <div class="max-w-2xl">
      <!-- Intro -->
      <p class="text-base text-text-primary leading-relaxed mb-8">
        Not sure how much cake to order, or which one suits the occasion? Here is a short guide to help.
      </p>

      <!-- The core guide — brandbook Reference 2, adapted -->
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-happy-blue-900 mb-5">
        Ten guests — a worked example
      </h2>

      <ol class="space-y-5 mb-10">
        <li class="card-border bg-cream-100 p-5">
          <p class="font-body font-semibold text-sm text-happy-blue-900 mb-1">1. Plan for one slice per person, plus three for seconds.</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-text-primary leading-relaxed">
            A 1.2 kg cake serves ten guests comfortably. If the group has big cake fans, go up to 1.5 kg.
          </p>
        </li>

        <li class="card-border bg-cream-100 p-5">
          <p class="font-body font-semibold text-sm text-happy-blue-900 mb-1">2. If half your guests are children, choose cake &ldquo;Milk Maiden&rdquo;.</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-text-primary leading-relaxed">
            Light vanilla biscuit and tender butter cream. Mild flavour, rarely refused by children or adults with modest sweet preferences. 1.2 kg.
          </p>
        </li>

        <li class="card-border bg-cream-100 p-5">
          <p class="font-body font-semibold text-sm text-happy-blue-900 mb-1">3. For adults who like coffee, try cake &ldquo;Tiramisu&rdquo;.</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-text-primary leading-relaxed">
            Vanilla biscuit with espresso, milk-chocolate layers, mascarpone cream. A good fit for evening celebrations. 1.0 kg.
          </p>
        </li>

        <li class="card-border bg-cream-100 p-5">
          <p class="font-body font-semibold text-sm text-happy-blue-900 mb-1">4. For a crowd that likes classics, cake &ldquo;Honey&rdquo; is the safe bet.</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-text-primary leading-relaxed">
            Six layers of golden honey biscuit, soft custard, walnuts pressed lightly into the top. Same recipe since we opened. 1.2 kg, $42.
          </p>
        </li>

        <li class="card-border bg-cream-100 p-5">
          <p class="font-body font-semibold text-sm text-happy-blue-900 mb-1">5. Order at least 24 hours ahead.</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-text-primary leading-relaxed">
            This lets us bake to your order, not from stock. For a weekend event, order by Thursday afternoon. If you need a same-day cake, check availability with us first — we&rsquo;ll tell you honestly what&rsquo;s on the counter.
          </p>
        </li>
      </ol>

      <!-- Larger events -->
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-happy-blue-900 mb-4">
        Larger groups
      </h2>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-10">
        <table class="w-full text-sm border-collapse">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-happy-blue-900 text-text-on-blue">
              <th class="text-left px-4 py-3 font-medium">Guests</th>
              <th class="text-left px-4 py-3 font-medium">Cake weight</th>
              <th class="text-left px-4 py-3 font-medium">What to order</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="bg-cream-100 border-b border-[rgba(14,42,60,0.12)]">
              <td class="px-4 py-3">6–8</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-3">1.0 kg</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-3">Cake "Tiramisu" or cake "Pistachio Roll"</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="bg-cream-50 border-b border-[rgba(14,42,60,0.12)]">
              <td class="px-4 py-3">10–12</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-3">1.2 kg</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-3">Cake "Honey" or cake "Milk Maiden"</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="bg-cream-100 border-b border-[rgba(14,42,60,0.12)]">
              <td class="px-4 py-3">15–20</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-3">2 × 1.2 kg</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-3">Two cakes — one classic, one lighter</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="bg-cream-50">
              <td class="px-4 py-3">20+</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-3">Ask us</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-3">We&rsquo;ll plan the order with you</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <!-- Dietary considerations -->
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-happy-blue-900 mb-4">
        Dietary notes
      </h2>
      <ul class="space-y-2 mb-10 text-sm text-text-primary">
        <li>All our cakes contain wheat, eggs, and dairy.</li>
        <li>Some cakes carry a halal-friendly label — check individual product pages.</li>
        <li>For nut allergies: our kitchen handles nuts daily, so we cannot guarantee a nut-free product. Ask us before ordering.</li>
        <li>For other allergens, <a href="https://wa.me/12815550100" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-happy-blue-500 hover:text-happy-blue-700">send us a message</a> and we will go through the ingredients with you.</li>
      </ul>

      <!-- CTA -->
      <div class="card-border bg-cream-100 p-6 text-center">
        <p class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-happy-blue-900 mb-2">
          Ready to order?
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm text-text-primary mb-4">
          Place your order on the site and we will confirm within the hour.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
          <a href="/order" class="btn-primary">Order a cake</a>
          <a href="/policies" class="btn-secondary">See policies</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Closing pattern (brand.r8) -->
      <p class="text-sm text-text-primary mt-8 closing-pattern">
        Order on the site at happycake.us or send a message on WhatsApp.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
